<div class="case-story insta-story container">
  <section class="story-section" id="case-brief" aria-labelledby="insta-brief">
    <div class="story-heading"><span class="micro">01 / the brief</span><h2 id="insta-brief">One weekend. Two ways to move.</h2></div>
    <div class="audience-grid">
      <div class="audience-card cycling"><div class="audience-top"><span class="micro">Cyclists · Hero Ride</span><span class="audience-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h3>Capture the ride from the inside.</h3><div class="audience-bottom"><span>Paris · Tour de France finale weekend</span><strong>Select the riders and show what to film.</strong></div></div>
      <div class="audience-card running"><div class="audience-top"><span class="micro">Runners · community workshop</span><span class="audience-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div><h3>Make cameras relevant to a run.</h3><div class="audience-bottom"><span>The people, places, and moments along the way</span><strong>Adapt the product story to a different sport.</strong></div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="short-take">My brief: choose who would ride with a camera, then turn a broad product brochure into two audience-specific workshop decks.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="story-section" id="case-contribution" aria-labelledby="insta-selection">
    <div class="story-heading"><span class="micro">02 / my contribution</span><h2 id="insta-selection">Choose the people behind the footage.</h2></div>
    <div class="rider-process" aria-label="Rider selection process">
      <div><span class="micro">Clean</span><h3>One rider.<br />One response.</h3><p>Remove duplicate and incomplete registrations.</p></div>
      <div><span class="micro">Review</span><h3>Riding habit<br />+ story quality.</h3><p>Look for regular riding and thoughtful answers.</p></div>
      <div class="selection-result"><strong>100</strong><span>camera-equipped riders selected</span></div>
      <div class="selection-result"><strong>10</strong><span>rider stories flagged for promotion</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="short-take">The selection choice: prioritize riding experience and storytelling over first-come-first-served.</p>
    <p class="scope-note">Process illustration. Starting registration counts and conversion rates are not shown.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="story-section" id="case-work" aria-labelledby="insta-work">
    <div class="story-heading"><span class="micro">03 / visual work</span><h2 id="insta-work">Same cameras. Different reasons to film.</h2></div>
    <p class="reconstruction-note">Original portfolio summaries of my workshop positioning. These illustrative panels are not reproductions of the internal decks.</p>
    <div class="deck-grid">
      <article class="deck-card">
        <div class="deck-visual bike-deck"><span class="deck-kicker">CYCLING / WORKSHOP POSITIONING</span><h3>The ride.<br />The people.<br />The memories.</h3><svg viewBox="0 0 440 170" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 140C95 150 95 25 195 45S305 150 425 46" stroke-dasharray="6 10" opacity=".45"/><circle cx="147" cy="117" r="30" fill="#FAF8F4"/><circle cx="267" cy="117" r="30" fill="#FAF8F4"/><path d="M147 117L180 64L219 117H147L193 81H249L267 117M238 52H251L249 81M172 62H193M215 18L193 43L210 67L240 70M193 43L174 33"/><circle cx="230" cy="14" r="10" fill="#FAF8F4"/></svg><span class="deck-mark">01 / make features useful on a bike</span></div>
        <div class="deck-caption"><span class="micro">Cycling deck · 4 cameras</span><h3>Lead with the riding use case.</h3><p>Hands-free POV, bike mounting, and creator examples made the product benefits concrete.</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="deck-card">
        <div class="deck-visual run-deck"><span class="deck-kicker">RUNNING / WORKSHOP POSITIONING</span><h3>More than<br />the distance.</h3><svg viewBox="0 0 440 170" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 141C90 74 106 164 174 103S289 160 421 56" stroke-dasharray="6 10" opacity=".45"/><circle cx="232" cy="31" r="12" fill="#FAF8F4"/><path d="M217 53L192 87L221 105L198 143M219 58L247 75L272 53M211 64L177 60L158 79M221 105L252 117L280 106M194 143L181 147M280 106L289 108"/><path d="M306 30V46M298 38H314M123 102V114M117 108H129"/></svg><span class="deck-mark">02 / give runners moments to capture</span></div>
        <div class="deck-caption"><span class="micro">Running deck · 2 cameras</span><h3>Lead with the moments along the way.</h3><p>People, stops, places, journey, and memories connected the cameras to a running routine.</p></div>
