    </div>
    <p class="short-take">I curated <strong>18 creator demo videos</strong> across both decks and adapted the partnership story for each audience.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="story-section outcome" id="case-outcome" aria-labelledby="insta-outcome">
    <div class="story-heading"><span class="micro">04 / outcome & next step</span><h2 id="insta-outcome">The event ran.<br />The measurement loop stayed open.</h2></div>
    <p>My deliverables were rider selection and workshop decks, prepared from HQ. Event-wide, <strong>200+ riders</strong> covered <strong>90 km</strong> from Versailles to the Champs-Élysées. I did not attend on site or receive data on how many selected riders posted.</p>
    <div class="event-facts" aria-label="Event-wide results, not individual performance metrics"><div><strong>200+</strong><span>riders at the event</span></div><div><strong>90 km</strong><span>Versailles → Champs-Élysées</span></div></div>
    <div class="next-test"><span class="micro">What I’d test next</span><p>Track sign-up source, selection scores, and who posts afterward. Use that feedback to improve the next rider shortlist.</p></div>
